        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terri Nunn, Sonya Scarlet, John Buckner Crawford, Virginia Macolino\n- Organizations: Berlin, Theatres des Vampires\n- Products: Information (Berlin album)\n- Roles: singer, actress, lyricist, singer-songwriter, lead vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Terri Nunn was born on June 26, 1961, and Terri Nunn is an American singer and actress.\n- John Buckner Crawford was born on January 17, 1960, and John Buckner Crawford is an American singer-songwriter.\n- Sonya Scarlet was born on April 2, 1980, and Sonya Scarlet is the singer and lyricist of the Italian extreme gothic metal band Theatres des Vampires.\n- John Buckner Crawford's efforts with the band Berlin were an essential part of Berlin's rise to fame in the early 1980s.\n- During the recording period of the album Information, Terri Nunn had temporarily left Berlin to pursue an acting career.\n- During the recording period of the album Information, Virginia Macolino performed the lead vocals.",
